@@ -1,5 +1,16 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## [2.48.0] — 2026-10-30
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Bound Git rewrite-state metadata reads and subprocesses (#798). Refuse links,
+  irregular and oversized files rather than hanging or fingerprinting an unknown
+  state. Resolve actual Git paths so linked worktrees inspect common metadata.
+- Inspect rewrite state before entry-time object reads and fail closed when it
+  becomes uninspectable after the agent or verification. Run JSON adds the
+  `GIT_REWRITE_STATE_UNAVAILABLE` reason; the changed schema has a new release URL.
+
 ## [2.47.2] — 2026-10-30
 
 ### Fixed
